<section image-layout="blank" id="lqrsvuutJZ" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="eKBuCula7u"><h2>Meet ozone: three oxygen atoms</h2><grid spacing="large"><grid-item id="Oxw9pR7csX" vertical-align="center" colspan="22"><p font-size="lg">Ozone is <b>O₃</b>: three oxygen atoms joined together. Most protective ozone is in the <b>stratosphere</b>, above our weather.</p><p font-size="lg">It is a spread-out region of gas, not a solid shell. Ozone near the ground is a separate air-pollution problem.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="swhEUOzs1b" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><freeform-block w="500" h="120"><shape preset="line" x="103" y="51" w="22" h="2" stroke="palette-4" stroke-width="5"></shape><shape preset="line" x="203" y="51" w="22" h="2" stroke="palette-4" stroke-width="5"></shape><box type="content" x="25" y="12" w="78" h="78" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="accent" style="border-radius:999pt;"><h3 align="center">O</h3></box><box type="content" x="125" y="12" w="78" h="78" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="accent" style="border-radius:999pt;"><h3 align="center">O</h3></box><box type="content" x="225" y="12" w="78" h="78" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="accent" style="border-radius:999pt;"><h3 align="center">O</h3></box><box type="content" x="320" y="30" w="170"><p font-size="18pt"><b>O₃</b><br/>one ozone molecule</p></box></freeform-block><grid direction="vertical" divider="sm palette-5" vertical-sizing="hug" spacing="none"><grid-item background-color="palette-4" padding="10pt 14pt"><h4>STRATOSPHERE</h4><p font-size="18pt">A region of gas above the weather.</p></grid-item><grid-item background-color="accent" padding="10pt 14pt"><h4>PROTECTIVE OZONE REGION</h4><p font-size="18pt">O₃ is spread through the air—not a solid wall.</p></grid-item><grid-item background-color="surface" padding="10pt 14pt"><h4>WEATHER BELOW</h4><p font-size="18pt">Clouds and weather happen lower down, near Earth’s surface.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>